 x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u4grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 4 • LESSON 2</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Zameer-e-Muttasil Muzakkar Ghaib: بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتُهُ (Page 6–7)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">بَيْتٌ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Zameer (ـهُ)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">بَيْتُهُ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• بَيْتٌ (Ghar) se بَيْتُهُ (Uska ghar) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Qur'an Majeed mein yeh tarkeeb saikdon maqamaat par barah-e-raast samajh aati hai.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 6–7):** Kisi bhi ism (naam) ke aakhir mein **`ـهُ`** lagane se **'Uska / Uski'** ka mafhoom paida hota hai aur ism ke aakhir ki Tanween (`ـٌ`) hat kar sirf ek Pesh (`ـُ`) reh jata hai: `بَيْتٌ ← بَيْتُهُ` (uska ghar), `رَبٌّ ← رَبُّهُ` (uska Rabb), `فَأَجْرُهُ عَلَى اللَّهِ` (toh uska ajr Allah ke zimme hai)."}},{"id":"sec_s4l2_lbl0","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Practice: Suffix-Table"}},{"id":"sec_s4l2_g1","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s4l2_g1_w1","arabic":"رَبٌّ : رَبُّهُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبٌّ : رَبُّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span>","hinglish":"Rabb : uska Rabb","translations":{"en":"Lord : His Lord","ur":"رب : اس کا رب","hi":"रब : उसका रब"}},{"id":"s4l2_g1_w2","arabic":"رَسُولٌ : رَسُولُهُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">رَسُولٌ : رَسُولُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span>","hinglish":"Rasool : uska Rasool","translations":{"en":"Messenger : His Messenger","ur":"رسول : اس کا رسول","hi":"रसूल : उसका रसूल"}},{"id":"s4l2_g1_w3","arabic":"قَوْمٌ : قَوْمُهُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمٌ : قَوْمُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span>","hinglish":"Qom : uski qom","translations":{"en":"People : His people","ur":"قوم : اس کی قوم","hi":"क़ौम : उसकी क़ौम"}},{"id":"s4l2_g1_w4","arabic":"عَرْشٌ : عَرْشُهُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عَرْشٌ : عَرْشُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span>","hinglish":"Arsh : uska arsh","translations":{"en":"Throne : His Throne","ur":"عرش : اس کا عرش","hi":"अर्श : उसका अर्श"}},{"id":"s4l2_g1_w5","arabic":"عَمَلٌ : عَمَلُهُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عَمَلٌ : عَمَلُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span>","hinglish":"Amal : uska amal","translations":{"en":"Deed : His deed","ur":"عمل : اس کا عمل","hi":"अमल : उसका अमल"}},{"id":"s4l2_g1_w6","arabic":"قَوْلٌ : قَوْلُهُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْلٌ : قَوْلُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span>","hinglish":"Baat : uski baat","translations":{"en":"Word : His word","ur":"بات : اس کی بات","hi":"बात : उसकी बात"}},{"id":"s4l2_g1_w7","arabic":"كُرْسِيٌّ : كُرْسِيُّهُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">كُرْسِيٌّ : كُرْسِيُّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span>","hinglish":"Kursi 