ी खड़ी थी"},"ref":"11:71"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s10","sentence_number":10,"arabic":"وَأُمُّهُ صِدِّيقَةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَأُمُّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">صِدِّيقَةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Aur uski maa rast-baz thi","translations":{"en":"And his mother was a supporter of truth","ur":"اور اس کی ماں راست باز تھی","hi":"और उसकी माँ रास्त-बाज़ थी"},"ref":"5:75"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s11","sentence_number":11,"arabic":"وَكَانَ عَرْشُهُ عَلَى الْمَاءِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَكَانَ عَرْشُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَلَى الْمَاءِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur uska arsh paani par tha","translations":{"en":"And His Throne was upon the water","ur":"اور اس کا عرش پانی پر تھا","hi":"और उसका अर्श पानी पर था"},"ref":"11:7"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s12","sentence_number":12,"arabic":"كَانَ مِقْدَارُهُ أَلْفَ سَنَةٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">كَانَ مِقْدَارُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَلْفَ سَنَةٍ</span>","hinglish":"Uski miqdar hazar saal Thi","translations":{"en":"Its measure was a thousand years","ur":"اس کی مقدار ہزار سال تھی","hi":"उसकी मिक़दार हज़ार साल थी"},"ref":"32:5"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s13","sentence_number":13,"arabic":"عِنْدَهُ / عِلْمُ السَّاعَةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">عِنْدَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">عِلْمُ السَّاعَةِ</span>","hinglish":"Uske paas qiyamat ka ilm hai","translations":{"en":"With Him is knowledge of the Hour","ur":"اس کے پاس قیامت کا علم ہے","hi":"उसके पास क़यामत का इल्म है"},"ref":"31:34"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s14","sentence_number":14,"arabic":"وَعِنْدَهُ مَفَاتِحُ الْغَيْبِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَعِنْدَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَفَاتِحُ الْغَيْبِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur uske paas ghaib ki kunjiyan hain","translations":{"en":"And with Him are the keys of the unseen","ur":"اور اس کے پاس غیب کی کنجیاں ہیں","hi":"और उसके पास ग़ैब की कुंजियाँ हैं"},"ref":"6:59"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s15","sentence_number":15,"arabic":"وَاللهُ وَرَسُولُهُ أَحَقُّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَاللهُ وَرَسُولُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَحَقُّ</span>","hinglish":"Aur Allah aur uska Rasool sab se ziyaada haq-dar hain","translations":{"en":"While Allah and His Messenger are more worthy","ur":"اور اللہ اور اس کا رسول سب سے زیادہ حق دار ہیں","hi":"और अल्लाह और उसका रसूल सबसे ज़्यादा हक़दार हैं"},"ref":"9:62"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s16","sentence_number":16,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ اللهَ / هُوَ مَوْلَاهُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَإِنَّ اللهَ / هُوَ مَوْلَا</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span>","hinglish":"Toh beshak Allah hi uska maula hai","translations":{"en":"Then indeed, Allah is his protector","ur":"تو بیشک اللہ ہی اس کا مولا ہے","hi":"तो बेशक अल्लाह ही उसका मौला है"},"ref":"66:4"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s17","sentence_number":17,"arabic":"وَقَلْبُهُ / مُطْمَئِنٌّ بِالْإِيمَانِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَقَلْبُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُطْمَئِنٌّ بِالْإِيمَانِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur uska dil eeman par mutma'in hai","translations":{"en":"While his heart is content with faith","ur":"اور اس کا دل ایمان پر مطمئن ہے","hi":"और उसका दिल ईमान पर मुतमइन है"},"ref":"16:106"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s18","sentence_number":18,"arabic":"سُبْحَانَهُ / هُوَ الْغَنِيُّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">سُبْحَانَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">هُوَ الْغَنِيُّ</span>","hinglish":"Uski zaat pak hai, wohi beniyaaz hai","translations":{"en":"Exalted is He; He is the Free of need","ur":"اس کی ذات پاک ہے، وہی بے نیاز ہے","hi":"उसकी ज़ात पाक है, वही बे-नियाज़ है"},"ref":"10:68"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s19","sentence_number":19,"arabic":"إِنَّمَا اللهُ / إِلٰهٌ وَاحِدٌ / سُبْحَانَهُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّمَا اللهُ / إِلٰهٌ وَاحِدٌ / سُبْحَانَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span>","hinglish":"Sirf Allah hi ek mabood hai, uski zaat pak hai","translations":{"en":"Allah is only One God; exalted is He","ur":"صرف اللہ ہی ایک معبود ہے، اس کی ذات پاک ہے","hi":"सिर्फ़ अल्लाह ही एक माबूद है, उसकी ज़ात पाक है"},"ref":"4:171"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s20","sentence_number":20,"arabic":"أَعِنْدَهُ / عِلْمُ الْغَيْبِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">أَعِنْدَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> / <span class=\"arabic-root\">عِلْمُ الْغَيْبِ</span>","hinglish":"Kya uske paas ghaib ka ilm hai?","translations":{"en":"Does he have knowledge of the unseen?","ur":"کیا اس کے پاس غیب کا علم ہے؟","hi":"क्या उसके पास ग़ैब का इल्म है?"},"ref":"53:35"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s21","sentence_number":21,"arabic":"كُلُّ شَيْءٍ هَالِكٌ / إِلَّا وَجْهَهُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">كُلُّ شَيْءٍ هَالِكٌ / إِلَّا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَجْهَهُ</span>","hinglish":"Har cheez halak hone wali hai siwaye uske chehre ke","translations":{"en":"Everything will be destroyed except His Face","ur":"ہر چیز ہلاک ہونے والی ہے سوائے اس کے چہرے کے","hi":"हर चीज़ हलाक होने वाली है सिवाय उसके चेहरे के"},"ref":"28:88"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s22","sentence_number":22,"arabic":"وَاللهُ / عِنْدَهُ أَجْرٌ عَظِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَاللهُ / عِنْدَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَجْرٌ عَظِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Aur Allah ke paas bada ajr hai","translations":{"en":"And Allah - with Him is a great reward","ur":"اور اللہ کے پاس بڑا اجر ہے","hi":"और अल्लाह के पास बड़ा अज्र है"},"ref":"64:15"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s23","sentence_number":23,"arabic":"إِنَّ اللهَ / عِنْدَهُ أَجْرٌ عَظِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّ اللهَ / عِنْدَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَجْرٌ عَظِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Allah ke paas bada ajr hai","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Allah - with Him is a great reward","ur":"بیشک اللہ کے پاس بڑا اجر ہے","hi":"बेशक अल्लाह के पास बड़ा अज्र है"},"ref":"9:22"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s24","sentence_number":24,"arabic":"إِنَّ اللهَ / عِنْدَهُ عِلْمُ السَّاعَةِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّ اللهَ / عِنْدَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عِلْمُ السَّاعَةِ</span>","hinglish":"Beshak Allah ke paas qiyamat ka ilm hai","translations":{"en":"Indeed, Allah - with Him is knowledge of the Hour","ur":"بیشک اللہ کے پاس قیامت کا علم ہے","hi":"बेशक अल्लाह के पास क़यामत का इल्म है"},"ref":"31:34"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s25","sentence_number":25,"arabic":"اسْمُهُ أَحْمَدُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">اسْمُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَحْمَدُ</span>","hinglish":"Uska naam Ahmad hai","translations":{"en":"His name is Ahmad","ur":"اس کا نام احمد ہے","hi":"उसका नाम अहमद है"},"ref":"61:6"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s26","sentence_number":26,"arabic":"اسْمُهُ الْمَسِيحُ عِيسَى ابْنُ مَرْيَمَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">اسْمُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمَسِيحُ عِيسَى ابْنُ مَرْيَمَ</span>","hinglish":"Uska naam Maseeh Isa ibn Maryam (Alaihis Salam) hai","translations":{"en":"His name is the Messiah, Jesus, the son of Mary","ur":"اس کا نام مسیح عیسیٰ ابن مریم (علیہ السلام) ہے","hi":"उसका नाम मसीह ईसा इब्न मरयम (अलैहिस्सलाम) है"},"ref":"3:45"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s27","sentence_number":27,"arabic":"خِتَامُهُ مِسْكٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">خِتَامُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مِسْكٌ</span>","hinglish":"Uski mohar kasturi ki hai","translations":{"en":"Its seal is musk","ur":"اس کی مہر کستوری کی ہے","hi":"उसकी मोहर कस्तूरी की है"},"ref":"83:26"},{"id":"s4l2_s3_s28","sentence_number":28,"arabic":"وَمِزَاجُهُ مِنْ تَسْنِيمٍ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَمِزَاجُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هُ</span> <span class=\"arabi